There are some clothes in front of me.
I pick up the next piece of clothing.
This is a cotton skirt.
Its colour is yellow.
It is a bright yellow skirt.
I put on this skirt.
I look in the mirror.
This skirt is very small.
It is also very tight.
It is not good for me.
Then I look at its tag.
The price on it is very high.
It is very expensive.
A small and expensive skirt!
I do not want this skirt.
I take it off.
I put it aside on the chair.
This skirt is not for me.
